 "name_en": "Predictive Commitments Management (2I3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Predictive Commitments Management (2I3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Commitment management is part of the cost monitoring process. Commitment items for projects are triggered by material purchase requisitions and purchase orders and are reduced by various business transactions such as goods receipt. A project cost report shows commitments versus plan and actual costs.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If this scope item is activated and the prerequisite scope item of Project Financial Control (1NT) is performed, the Project Financial Controller can monitor purchase order commitments against plan and actual costs in a report.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If the scope item is activated, and the prerequisite scope item of Overhead Cost Accounting (J54) is performed, the Cost Accountant-Overhead can monitor purchase order commitments by cost center and cost element in a report.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor projects</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze project costs with information on commitments compared with actual and plan costs</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>预测承诺管理 (2I3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">承诺管理是成本监控流程的一部分。项目的承诺项目由物料采购申请和采购订单触发，并由各种业务交易（如收货）减少。项目成本报表显示承诺与计划和实际成本。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果激活此范围项目并执行项目财务控制 (1NT) 的前提条件范围项目，则项目财务控制员可以根据报表中的计划和实际成本监控采购订单承诺。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果激活范围项目，并执行间接费用成本会计 (J54) 的前提条件范围项目，则成本会计 - 间接费用可以按报表中的成本中心和成本要素监控采购订单承诺。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">监控项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob169316234ff4604b0902b78067419a0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用与实际成本和计划成本相比，使用承诺信息分析项目成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
